    metaDesc: 'Understand Veeva Vault — the leading pharma content management platform. Vault QMS, eTMF, RIM, Safety, CDMS applications explained with career guide for Veeva professionals.',
    h1: 'What Is Veeva Vault? The Pharmaceutical Content Management Platform Explained',
    intro: 'Veeva Vault is a cloud-based content management platform purpose-built for the life sciences industry. Developed by Veeva Systems, Vault is the leading platform for managing pharmaceutical documents, regulatory submissions, clinical trial data, quality records, and safety information. Multiple specialized applications run on the Vault platform — QualityDocs, eTMF, RIM, Submissions Archive, CDMS, Safety — all sharing the same underlying document management, workflow, and audit trail infrastructure. Veeva Vault expertise is one of the most in-demand skills across pharma functional areas.',
