        body: 'The Registrations module manages global marketing authorizations. Features: Global product registration database (all countries where a product is registered with MA numbers, approval dates, expiry dates), Variation management (tracking EU Type IA/IB/II variations, FDA CBE-30s, Prior Approval Supplements — workflow, submission dates, approval status), Labeling management (current approved label text by country, historical versions, planned changes), Regulatory contacts (authority contacts by country, submission gateway information), Renewal management (upcoming MA renewals with advance notification), and import/export capabilities for global registration data. Registrations module enables RA teams to answer "What is our current registration status in country X?" instantly.',
